&lt;p&gt;exception:&lt;br/&gt;
kong.unirest.json.JSONException: JSONObject&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;&amp;quot;progress&amp;quot;&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; not found.&lt;br/&gt;
